# Sample requests for VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client.
# Default target: the Opus build (benchmark winner). Change @host to 3001 (Codex) or 3003 (Synergy) to compare.
@host = http://localhost:3002

### Create a transfer (TASKS.md sample)
POST {{host}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount": "ACC-12345", "toAccount": "ACC-67890", "amount": 100.50, "currency": "USD", "type": "transfer"}

### Create a deposit
POST {{host}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"toAccount": "ACC-12345", "amount": 500, "currency": "USD", "type": "deposit"}

### Create a withdrawal
POST {{host}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount": "ACC-12345", "amount": 20.25, "currency": "EUR", "type": "withdrawal"}

### Validation: negative amount + bad currency → 400 with details
POST {{host}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount": "ACC-12345", "toAccount": "ACC-67890", "amount": -5, "currency": "XYZ", "type": "transfer"}

### Validation: 3 decimal places → 400
POST {{host}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount": "ACC-12345", "toAccount": "ACC-67890", "amount": 10.555, "currency": "USD", "type": "transfer"}

### Validation: bad account format → 400
POST {{host}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount": "ACC-12", "toAccount": "ACC-67890", "amount": 10, "currency": "USD", "type": "transfer"}

### List all transactions
GET {{host}}/transactions

### Filter by account
GET {{host}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### Filter by type
GET {{host}}/transactions?type=transfer

### Filter by date range (inclusive)
GET {{host}}/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2030-12-31

### Combined filters
GET {{host}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=deposit&from=2024-01-01&to=2030-12-31

### Unknown id → 404
GET {{host}}/transactions/does-not-exist

### Balance
GET {{host}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Task 4A — summary
GET {{host}}/accounts/ACC-12345/summary

### Task 4B — simple interest
GET {{host}}/accounts/ACC-12345/interest?rate=0.05&days=30

### Task 4C — CSV export
GET {{host}}/transactions/export?format=csv
